        "Heroism",
        "Level 1 Enchantment (Bard, Paladin)",
        "Range: Touch",
        "Duration: Concentration, up to 1 minute",
        "A willing creature you touch",
        "immune to the Frightened condition",
        "Temporary Hit Points equal to your spellcasting ability modifier at the start of each of its turns",
