        "3d8 Radiant damage (if you are good or neutral)",
        "3d8 Necrotic damage (if you are evil)",
        "the creature takes half as much damage",
        "makes this save only once per turn",
        "The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 3"
      ],
      "177": [
        "If all straight lines extending from the point of origin to a location in the area of effect are blocked, that location isn’t included in the area of effect",
